  "prefLabel": "Env-A 4602.76 Undistributed CO2 allowances",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 4602.76 “Undistributed CO2 allowances” means CO2 budget allowances allocated to a set aside account in a given allocation year in accordance with RSA 125-O:22, VI or 125-O:25 that have not been distributed during that allocation year .\n\nSource. #10468, eff 1-1-14; ss by #12967, eff 1-1-20 (from Env-A 4602.77)",
